{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14992","headline":"陈翃中丞东斋赋白玉簪 · 卢纶","name":"陈翃中丞东斋赋白玉簪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美矣新成太华峰，翠莲枝折叶重重。\n松阴满涧闲飞鹤，潭影通云暗上龙。\n漠漠水香风颇馥，涓涓乳溜味何浓。\n因声远报浮丘子，不奏登封时不容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}